@title Cedar Hollow Elementary, October family newsletter
@subtitle Thank you for a busy and happy fall
@author Dr. Lucia Hernandez, Principal

Dear families, here is what is coming up this month.

## Dates to remember
- Online booking for parent-teacher conferences opens on 2026-10-26.
- Parent-teacher conferences: 2026-11-05 and 2026-11-06, from 15:30 to 19:00.
- Book Fair in the library: 2026-11-09 to 2026-11-13.
- No school on 2026-11-11 for Veterans Day.
- No school from 2026-11-25 to 2026-11-27 for Thanksgiving break.

## Reading challenge
Our whole school set a goal of 60000 minutes read by 2026-12-18.

kpi Goal progress | 36% | 21400 of 60000 minutes so far | bar

Room 12, Ms. Okafor's class, is in the lead with 3150 minutes. Please send reading logs in the red folder every Friday.

## Drop-off and pick-up
- The lane opens at 07:45, and the bell rings at 08:15.
- Do not turn left out of the lot onto Alder Street.
- Please use the east lot for pick-up.
- Students must be picked up by 15:45. After that they go to the after-school office, which charges $5 per 15 minutes.

## Thank you
Thank you to the 38 volunteers who ran the Fall Fair. It raised $9,640 for the library.

Thank you also to the families who sent in 412 cans of food for the neighborhood pantry. You make this school a good place to be.
